resultColumnLogicalType←{
⍝ Return result column logical type handle at 0-based index, with bounds guard.
⍝ Usage: result resultColumnLogicalType col_idx
⍝ Caller must destroy returned logical type handle when non-zero.
    vals←,⍺
    ((1=≢vals)∧0=⊃vals)∨(⍵<0):0
    cnt←resultColumnCount ⍺
    ⍵≥cnt:0
    api.duckdb_column_logical_type ⍺ ⍵
}
